    "description": "<p>While using this Charm, the martial artist's familiarity with the extra reach her weapon provides allows her to strike first in hand-to-hand combat. Upon activating this Charm, the martial artist adds a number of extra successes equal to her Essence to the result of her Join Battle roll. When characters attack each other on the same tick, a speardancer who uses this Charm resolves her attack first. (If her opponent also uses a Charm that lets him act first, the characters remain tied.)</p>",
